    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl mb-6 leading-tight">Email marketing for manufacturers: what to send distributors, contractors and buyers</h1>
    <p class="text-xl text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Your buyers already live in their inbox. Here is how to turn product updates, spec sheets and quotes into emails they open and act on.</p>
  </div>
